<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>Success Rate vs Inference Delay <math id="S5.F6.sf1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math> (Execution Horizon: e=40). A2C2 remains robust under inference delays.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
