<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Results of LIBERO Spatial: Comparison of Success Rate under different conditions. (a) Effect of inference delay with fixed execution horizon. (b) Effect of execution horizon with no inference delay. Each data point is evaluated on 10 tasks, each with 10 rollouts, resulting in a total of 100 rollouts.</figcaption>
</figure>
