<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>LIBERO Simulation Detail</h3>

<section id="A1.SS2.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.2.1 </span>Environment</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">LIBERO Spatial consists of 10 tasks. We evaluated all tasks, and the corresponding language instructions are listed below.
The language instructions are:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ol id="A1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">pick up the black bowl between the plate and the ramekin and place it on the plate</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">pick up the black bowl next to the ramekin and place it on the plate</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
